abstract: >-
  Single-file HTML prototype that implements the readiness gate, live
  re-gating, route risk, QEHS performance index and maturity score of the
  TRIAD-QEHS framework for integrated journey, driver and vehicle management
  in chemical road transport.
keywords:
  - dangerous goods
  - chemical road transport
  - journey management
  - QEHS
  - readiness gate
